"The DJ is a session: start it from the DJ button in the player, from the queue menu or from the Home screen. While it is on, it sorts the next songs so they fit together (tempo and key) and mixes each song into the next at its natural exit, near the end of the last chorus, with a longer blend when the two songs match well. To move on earlier, press Next: it mixes into the next song straight away. Long songs and podcasts play in full. Mixes between songs that are not downloaded need Wi-Fi, or mobile data allowed in the AutoMix settings." = "The DJ is a session: start it from the DJ button in the player, from the queue menu or from the Home screen. While it is on, it sorts the next songs so they fit together (tempo and key) and mixes each song into the next at its natural exit, near the end of the last chorus, with a longer blend when the two songs match well. To move on earlier, press Next: it mixes into the next song straight away. Long songs and podcasts play in full. Mixes between songs that are not downloaded need Wi-Fi, or mobile data allowed in the AutoMix settings.";
